160182379/605f7e564ce17decc9e09508567776ce_5737054899684571258.jpg\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e摩拉\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*20000\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e专门进行了如此精致的舞台布置，看来你期待着一场精彩的表演呢。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e让我们猜一猜，全提瓦特最棒的大魔术师该不会正好有档期吧？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e不要担心，哪怕只有你一个观众，演出也将如期举行哦。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\"],[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"500597\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/01/05/50494840/225de61a823d3a8585fecd64370fe51b_5298962760500693439.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"正义之廷的繁荣商贸\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/500597/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/500597/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/01/05/50494840/225de61a823d3a8585fecd64370fe51b_5298962760500693439.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e正义之廷的繁荣商贸\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"854\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2020/07/01/80410800/615a1c099bb63b1dd994c6fa03286eb7_139347258334047132.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"燃愿玛瑙断片\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/854/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/854/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2020/07/01/80410800/615a1c099bb63b1dd994c6fa03286eb7_139347258334047132.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e燃愿玛瑙断片\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"5566\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/12/08/160182379/f9de059da2ee541c770eb1c83d0018a9_6412355601661015430.jpg\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"原石\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"20\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/5566/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/5566/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/12/08/160182379/f9de059da2ee541c770eb1c83d0018a9_6412355601661015430.jpg\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e原石\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*20\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"5565\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/12/08/160182379/605f7e564ce17decc9e09508567776ce_5737054899684571258.jpg\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"摩拉\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"20000\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/5565/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/5565/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target